{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778432405703,"sessionID":"ses_1ed2b2812ffeLjiv5mmXga7bGQ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_7uYmnffCW0nVbWV7lZiEuflU","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json","offset":1,"limit":2000},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"## Bug\\n\\nIn `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml`, line 46:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An acquired metabolic disease that is has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nShould be:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An inherited metabolic disease that has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nTwo issues:\\n1. **\\\"acquired\\\" should be \\\"inherited\\\"** — this is a pattern for inborn errors of metabolism, not acquired diseases. Appears to be a copy-paste from `acquired.yaml`.\\n2. **\\\"is has\\\" should be \\\"has\\\"** — minor grammar typo.\\n\\nThe `equivalentTo` clause correctly references `inborn errors of metabolism` (MONDO:0019052), so the logical definition is fine — only the text template is wrong.\\n\\nFound during analysis of the \\\"inborn\\\" classification axis in [#9986](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9986).\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"Copy-paste error in inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml: definition says 'acquired' instead of 'inherited'\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9987\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"## Bug\\n\\nIn `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml`, line 46:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An acquired metabolic disease that is has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nShould be:\\n\\n```yaml\\ndef:\\n  text: An inherited metabolic disease that has its basis in the disruption of %s.\\n```\\n\\nTwo issues:\\n1. **\\\"acquired\\\" should be \\\"inherited\\\"** — this is a pattern for inborn errors of metabolism, not acquired diseases. Appears to be a copy-paste from `acquired.yaml`.\\n2. **\\\"is has\\\" should be \\\"has\\\"** — minor grammar typo.\\n\\nThe `equivalentTo` clause correctly references `inborn errors of metabolism` (MONDO:0019052), so the logical definition is fine — only the text template is wrong.\\n\\nFound during analysis of the \\\"inborn\\\" classification axis in [#9986](https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9986).\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Copy-paste error in inborn_metabolic_disrupts.yaml: definition says 'acquired' instead of 'inherited'\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9987\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778432405693,"end":1778432405702}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0ad0f4dbba4d8093016a00b995139c8197b1a2b95a92505ff2"}},"id":"prt_e12d4ee75001cu6cGRQqGPF6sx","sessionID":"ses_1ed2b2812ffeLjiv5mmXga7bGQ","messageID":"msg_e12d4eaac001Z7frVqbap2QmhJ"}}
